GiveCampus API specifications

Everything under evidence/specs/ is GiveCampus' own published API specification,
committed verbatim so the generated client can be checked against the source it
was generated from. Those files are GiveCampus' work, not mine, and the MIT grant
above does not extend to them.

src/gcapi/operations.json and src/gcapi/operations.py are generated from those
specs by tools/generate_operations.py.

This is an unofficial client. It is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
supported by GiveCampus. No request was made to any GiveCampus host during its
development; tests/test_no_live_calls.py enforces that structurally.
